    LLM: "1. Trick won by last card of same rank as led. 2. May play top stock card ('in the dark'). 3. Cannot lead same rank four tricks in a row. 4. Draw from stock after each trick. 5. Clean: if took queen before stock empty, must win trick with king (not by queen) in last 5 tricks. 6. Fail to clean = dishonourable loss.",
